{"availability":"available","full":"LegenDairy93/discharge-navigator","name":"discharge-navigator","description":"Discharge Navigator converts unstructured clinical notes into schema-validated, evidence-grounded discharge packets using MedGemma 4B, running entirely offline on a consumer laptop.","category":"Productivity","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-02-17T22:23:59Z","updated":"2026-02-24T21:26:30Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/haguman/discharge-navigator-demo","topics":["applied-ai","edge-ai","evaluation","evidence-grounding","gradio","healthcare-ai","medgemma","offline-ai","ollama","pydantic"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/haguman/discharge-navigator-demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.479Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.479Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.479Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.479Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Offline structuring of clinical discharge notes using MedGemma 4B — built for where cloud AI can't reach.","Discharge summaries — what medications to take home, which follow-ups to attend, what warning signs to watch for — are critical handoff documents. But the tools to structure them don't exist where they're needed most: facilities with unreliable internet, no GPU hardware, and patient data that cannot leave the premises. Existing clinical AI assumes cloud infrastructure and stable connectivity. That's an architectural mismatch with the reality on the ground.","Discharge Navigator runs entirely offline on a consumer laptop — a 2.5 GB quantized model, CPU-only, zero internet after download. It reads a raw clinical note and extracts structured, evidence-grounded discharge packets: diagnoses, medications, follow-ups, red flags, and missing information — each backed by exact text spans from the source note that a clinician can verify before anything is applied."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LegenDairy93/discharge-navigator/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5569546556731b92b86a375f2c9dea8e5e822ca43ebfdf565bcbd62e345a9637","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.597Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.597Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Offline structuring of clinical discharge notes using MedGemma 4B — built for where cloud AI can't reach.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LegenDairy93/discharge-navigator/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Offline structuring of clinical discharge notes using MedGemma 4B — built for where cloud AI can't reach.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LegenDairy93/discharge-navigator/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"5569546556731b92b86a375f2c9dea8e5e822ca43ebfdf565bcbd62e345a9637","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LegenDairy93/discharge-navigator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.597Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-24T21:26:30Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LegenDairy93/discharge-navigator/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:20.597Z","hash":"5569546556731b92b86a375f2c9dea8e5e822ca43ebfdf565bcbd62e345a9637","originalBytes":4374,"storedBytes":4374,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kaggle","note","model","ollama","demo","discharge","grounding","clinical","edge","evaluation","evidence","gpu","cc0","cloud","cpu","exact","failures","google","huggingface","internet","medgemma","mtsamples","notebook","offline","required","results","source","spans","app.py","backend","backends","clinician","data","entrypoint.ipynb","environment","eval","extraction","follow-ups","gguf","golden","gradio","haguman","huggingface.co","inference","install","live","local","m-gguf","medgemma-4b-it","medgemma-4b-it-q4","medications","navigator","notebooks","notes","per-note","pipeline","prompt","pydantic","quick","report.md","run","runs","schema","src","start","structu